<heading class="block" style="-uslm-lc:I658032">CONGRESSIONAL RECORD, Vol. 170 (2024):</heading>
<p class="indentUp4 firstIndent-1" id="x78ee0e74-c18e-11f1-a37f-e7703b762a33" style="-uslm-lc:I658035">July 22, considered and passed House.</p><p class="indentUp4 firstIndent-1" id="x78ee0e75-c18e-11f1-a37f-e7703b762a33" style="-uslm-lc:I658035">Dec. 20, considered and passed Senate.</p></note>
</legislativeHistory>
