<officialTitle class="indentUp0 firstIndent1 fontsize8" style="-uslm-lc:I658011">To amend title 28, United States Code, to authorize holding court for the Central Division of Utah in Moab and Monticello.<sidenote><p class="centered fontsize8" id="x76bde869-c18e-11f1-a37f-e7703b762a33" style="-uslm-lc:I658076"><approvedDate date="2025-01-04">Jan. 4, 2025</approvedDate></p><p class="centered fontsize8" id="x76bde86a-c18e-11f1-a37f-e7703b762a33" style="-uslm-lc:I658076">[<ref href="/us/bill/118/hr/8666">H.R. 8666</ref>]<?GPOvSpace 08?></p></sidenote></officialTitle>
