<enactingFormula style="-uslm-lc:I658120"><i>  Be it enacted by the Senate and House of Representa­tives of the United States of America in Congress assembled,</i></enactingFormula>
<section role="instruction" style="-uslm-lc:I658146"><num class="bold" value="1">SECTION 1. </num><heading>JUDICIAL DISTRICT.</heading><content style="-uslm-lc:I658120">  <ref href="/us/usc/t28/s125">Section 125 of title 28, United States Code</ref>, <amendingAction type="amend">is amended</amendingAction> by <amendingAction type="delete">striking</amendingAction> “<quotedText>and St. George</quotedText>” and <amendingAction type="insert">inserting</amendingAction> “<quotedText>St. George, Moab, and Monticello.</quotedText>”</content></section>
